        <referenceFunction amount="1.0" category="waste management" datasetRelatesToProduct="true" generalComment="Disposal of a ventilation system for a building with a specific air flow rate of 4 m3/h per m2 heated gross floor area. The reference value of the inventory is 1 m2 heated gross floor area. The inventory is based on average data of 4 office buildings, 3 schools and 3 residential care homes with a total heated gross floor area of 61719 m2 and a total nominal air flow of 302190 m3/h, specific weight of the components: 8.51 kg/m2, including average components for air handling units, ducts including insulation, air valves, roof-hoods, dampers, fire dampers, silencers. The data represent a ductwork mainly made of galvanized steel and includes air handling units mainly with heat recovery and a nominal air flow rate of 5'000-20'000 m3/h per unit. No ground heat exchanger is included.;&#10;UUID: 26a06d15-a1ae-4469-b8e4-6455ed591d47" includedProcesses="Transport to dismantling facilities, machines for handling in sorting plant, electricity demand for sorting plant, final disposal of waste material. Cut-off to recycling for metals." infrastructureProcess="false" localCategory="waste management" localName="Disposal, ventilation system, centralized, average for 4 m3(hm2)" localSubCategory="building demolition" name="Disposal, ventilation system, centralized, average for 4 m3(hm2)" subCategory="building demolition" unit="m2"/>
